+/**
+ * Validate a persisted replay-invalidation record before it can drop anything.
+ * A session file can carry anything in this field (older writers, hand edits,
+ * partial JSON), so a malformed record is ignored whole rather than trusted
+ * partially — it must never cause a blanket drop or throw on the request path.
